+# Delta for Authority Store
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Additive Runner Receipt CAS Collection {#REQ-authority-store-018}
+
+The Authority Store MUST persist `runner-receipt/v1` records in an additive CAS collection distinct from OperationReceipt receipts. The public field name of that collection is design-owned. The collection MUST accept only records whose `kind` is `runner-receipt/v1`. A `runner-receipt/v1` record MUST NOT be stored as an OperationReceipt, and an OperationReceipt MUST NOT be stored in the runner-receipt collection. Kind mismatch MUST fail closed and MUST NOT advance the head.
+
+Existing `authority.receipts` OperationReceipt behavior MUST remain unchanged. Reloading the store from disk MUST restore the runner-receipt collection together with the authority bag, journal, and budgets, without manual snapshot extraction. This extends restart preservation; REQ-013 is unchanged.
+
+#### Scenario: Runner-receipt records persist in a distinct CAS collection
+
+- GIVEN a successful CAS that includes schema-valid `runner-receipt/v1` records
+- WHEN the winning revision is stored
+- THEN those records MUST reside in an additive CAS collection distinct from OperationReceipt receipts
+- AND `authority.receipts` MUST still contain only OperationReceipt values
+
+#### Scenario: Kind mismatch with OperationReceipt fails closed
+
+- GIVEN a CAS payload that places a `runner-receipt/v1` record among OperationReceipt receipts, or an OperationReceipt in the runner-receipt collection
+- WHEN `compareAndSwap` is evaluated
+- THEN the call MUST fail closed
+- AND the head revision MUST remain unchanged
+
+#### Scenario: Restart restores runner-receipt records without mixing families
+
+- GIVEN a committed head that stores OperationReceipt receipts and `runner-receipt/v1` records in distinct collections
+- WHEN the process terminates and a new store instance loads from the same disk location
+- THEN both collections MUST be fully restored
+- AND recovery MUST NOT require invoking manual `snapshot()` extraction
+- AND the restored runner-receipt collection MUST NOT contain OperationReceipt values
